     Notes:

         • Due to the page limit and file limit, we can not provide every script of each simulation because they
           have slight differences to meet different task requirements. However, the codes of main part of our
           model stays the same. The following script is one version consists of all system described in our
           paper. Readers may modified few lines to get all the simulations mentioned in our paper.

         • Because this model based on probability calculations in marriage decision and Death system, same
           input in this model may have different results. However, the mean value of many runs should not
           vary far from the simulation results presented on our paper.

